USE [RCA_Phys_Code];
GO

SET NOCOUNT ON;
SET XACT_ABORT ON;

/*==============================================================
 PB AR059 RECOVERY SUMMARY BY REPORT REGION

 Final output level:
     Range
     Report Region
     Financial Class
     Recovery / Takeback

 Examples:
     Austin
     Brenham
     College Station
     HTPN WO&M
     HTPN JV
     Marble Falls
     Temple

 This version:
 1. Loads the authorized PB facility structure.
 2. Maps PB facilities to verified Report Regions.
 3. Runs AR059 once per range.
 4. Includes only Include Days Met records.
 5. Produces high-level Report Region summaries.
 6. Does not retain transaction-detail output.
 7. Retains run-log and unmapped-facility diagnostics.
==============================================================*/

------------------------------------------------------------
